  "worked_solution": "First, multiplying each component of $v$ by $2$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2v & =2[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}14 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}]\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo compute the dot product, we add up the products of corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(2v)\\cdot w & =14\\cdot 1+4\\cdot (-5)+6\\cdot 4+8\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =14-20+24-40 \\\\  & =-22\\end{aligned}\n$$",
